<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">To further solidify our commitment to fairness, we provide itemized written contracts for every single job.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This document serves as a binding agreement that details every aspect of the service, including the specific inventory of goods, the labor hours included, and the precise breakdown of charges for packing materials, transport, and unloading.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This level of granularity ensures that both parties have a clear understanding of the scope of work.</span></li></ul>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">For government employees and corporate clients who require strict adherence to financial regulations, we issue IBA-approved bills.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>These documents are fully compliant with Indian Bureau of Accounts standards, making them seamless for reimbursement claims and corporate accounting processes.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>We understand the bureaucratic hurdles involved in official relocations, and our documentation is designed to pass audits without friction or delay.</span></li></ul>

<p>Finally, we recognize that your possessions hold significant financial and sentimental value. That is why we include 100% declared-value transit insurance as standard, not an optional add-on. This comprehensive coverage protects your items against loss, damage, or theft during the entire transit period from Kapurthala to your destination.</p>
<p>The insurance policy is calculated based on the full declared value of your goods, ensuring that in the unlikely event of a claim, you are compensated for the actual replacement cost, not a depreciated amount. This full coverage provides peace of mind, knowing that your investment is protected by a robust financial safety net.</p>

