      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Step-by-Step Moving Day Workflow: Survey, Packing, Transit &amp; Placement for packers and movers in kapurthala</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Moving in Kapurthala begins with a thorough pre‑move assessment. The packing company schedules a video call or a physical survey of the residence to note dimensions, fragile items, staircases, elevators, and any access restrictions.</p>
<p>During this visit the estimator records a detailed inventory, photographs high‑value goods, and discusses special handling requirements (piano, artwork, antique furniture). A transparent quotation is then prepared, outlining labor, packing materials, insurance, and transit charges.</p>

