<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">On the moving day the crew follows a systematic room‑by‑room packing routine.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Each room is assigned a supervisor who labels boxes with a color‑coded system (e.g., red for kitchen, blue for bedrooms) and a unique number that matches the inventory sheet.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Items are wrapped in bubble wrap, packed in double‑wall cartons, and sealed with tamper‑proof tape.</span></li></ul>
<p>Heavy books go in small boxes, while lighter linens occupy larger ones to balance weight. Disassembled furniture is wrapped in protective blankets and secured with straps to prevent shifting.</p>

<ul>
  <li>Start with low‑traffic rooms (guest rooms, storage) before the kitchen.</li>
  <li>Wrap all glassware individually and place in “fragile” boxes.</li>
  <li>Use padding for corners of furniture and secure drawers with tape.</li>
  <li>Load boxes onto the truck in reverse order of unloading (last in, first out).</li>
</ul>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Safe transit is ensured by a well‑maintained fleet of trucks equipped with GPS tracking and suspension systems suited for Punjab’s road conditions.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The driver follows the most efficient route, avoiding peak traffic in Kapurthala’s market areas.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Cargo is anchored with straps and rubber mats to absorb vibrations, and a checklist is verified at each checkpoint to guarantee that nothing is left behind.</span></li></ul>

<ul>
  <li>Monitor truck location in real‑time via the company’s portal.</li>
  <li>Inspect cargo for any movement or damage every two hours.</li>
  <li>Maintain a temperature‑controlled environment for sensitive items if required.</li>
</ul>

<p>At the destination, the uncrating phase mirrors the packing order. The crew unloads boxes according to the color‑coded system, places them in the designated rooms, and reassembles furniture. A final walkthrough with the client compares the inventory sheet to the items delivered, noting any discrepancies.</p>
<p>Any minor damages are documented, and the insurer processes claims promptly. The result is a smooth, organized transition from the old home to the new one, with minimal stress for the Kapurthala resident.</p></div>
